{"schema_version":"genshin-world-lore-card-v1","lore_id":"nodkrai_overview","name_zh":"挪德卡莱","name_en":"Nod-Krai","aliases":["挪德卡莱","Nod-Krai","涅法海姆","Nephilheim","borderlands"],"category":"nation","scope":"regional","regions":["Nod-Krai"],"summary":"挪德卡莱是位于提瓦特边缘、至冬南端的自治地区，旧称涅法海姆。来自提瓦特各地的人汇聚于此，使其获得“冒险家的乐园”与“乐园”的声誉，但当地环境严酷、治安风险突出。该地区与古代月亮及月矩力关系密切，并长期受到狂猎威胁；霜月之子、执灯人、伏尼契商会、愚人众及外来远征力量均参与其当前局势。","canonical_facts":[{"fact_id":"nodkrai_fact_001","text":"挪德卡莱是位于提瓦特边缘、至冬南端的自治地区；那夏镇是其主要城镇。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"现状","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_nodkrai_overview","fandom_sup_nodkrai_overview_01","bwiki_nodkrai_overview"]},{"fact_id":"nodkrai_fact_002","text":"挪德卡莱旧称涅法海姆（Nephilheim）；英文资料亦以“borderlands”称呼该地区。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"旧称延续至今仍为部分人使用","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_nodkrai_overview","fandom_sup_nodkrai_overview_07","bwiki_nodkrai_overview"]},{"fact_id":"nodkrai_fact_003","text":"来自提瓦特各地的人会聚集在挪德卡莱，因此该地获得了“冒险家的乐园”与“乐园”的声誉。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"近现代至现状","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_nodkrai_overview","fandom_sup_nodkrai_overview_02"]},{"fact_id":"nodkrai_fact_004","text":"挪德卡莱的环境与治安均具有较高风险。利本曾陈述自己在进入那夏镇前后两度遭流民抢劫，其中伏尼契商会曾追回并收购他的货物。","status":"reported","temporal_scope":"利本近期的一次行商经历","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_nodkrai_overview","fandom_sup_nodkrai_overview_01"]},{"fact_id":"nodkrai_fact_005","text":"伏尼契商会是当地重要的秩序维持力量；遭受侵害的商旅可以向其寻求追偿或协助。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"现状","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_nodkrai_overview","fandom_sup_nodkrai_overview_01"]},{"fact_id":"nodkrai_fact_006","text":"挪德卡莱被描述为一轮未能显化的第四轮月亮所遗留的残余，这构成该地区与古代月亮联系的核心背景。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"远古起源","visibility":"secret_or_exceptional","source_ids":["fandom_nodkrai_overview","bwiki_nodkrai_overview"]},{"fact_id":"nodkrai_fact_007","text":"挪德卡莱包含那夏镇、希汐岛等地点；霜月之子主要居住于希汐岛及当地山林、荒野一带。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"现状","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_nodkrai_overview","bwiki_nodkrai_overview"]},{"fact_id":"nodkrai_fact_008","text":"霜月之子是挪德卡莱的原住民群体，信奉被称为月之少女的月神库塔尔；现有剧情确认其所指即哥伦比娅。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"长期信仰及现状","visibility":"restricted_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_nodkrai_overview","local_sup_nodkrai_overview_01","local_sup_nodkrai_overview_03","bwiki_nodkrai_overview"]},{"fact_id":"nodkrai_fact_009","text":"霜月之子在挪德卡莱各处制作了献给哥伦比娅的新月神像；当地人能够从外貌上辨认神像与她的相似之处。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"神像建造后至今","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_nodkrai_overview","local_sup_nodkrai_overview_01","bwiki_nodkrai_overview"]},{"fact_id":"nodkrai_fact_010","text":"挪德卡莱部分居民能够使用月矩力。该力量源自古代三月，并早于提瓦特现行的七元素体系。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"远古至今","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_nodkrai_overview","fandom_sup_nodkrai_overview_06","bwiki_nodkrai_overview"]},{"fact_id":"nodkrai_fact_011","text":"月之轮是与挪德卡莱及月亮相关、外观和用途类似神之眼的器物；其使用月矩力而非常规元素能量。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"远古创制后至今","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_nodkrai_overview_06","bwiki_nodkrai_overview"]},{"fact_id":"nodkrai_fact_012","text":"当地技术会利用月矩力。那夏镇的大炮以月矩力对抗狂猎并保护居民；将相关技术商品化并流入黑市，会被霜月之子视为对神力的亵渎。","status":"reported","temporal_scope":"现状","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["local_sup_nodkrai_overview_04"]},{"fact_id":"nodkrai_fact_013","text":"愚人众在挪德卡莱设有试验设计设施，并围绕月矩力、霜月之子的圣物及古月遗骸展开行动。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当前愚人众活动期间","visibility":"restricted_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_nodkrai_overview","fandom_sup_nodkrai_overview_08","local_sup_nodkrai_overview_03"]},{"fact_id":"nodkrai_fact_014","text":"狂猎现象已困扰挪德卡莱数百年。执灯人长期负责抵御狂猎与深渊侵袭，但历次清剿只能拖延灾害，未能将其彻底消除。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"灾变后数百年至今","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_nodkrai_overview","local_sup_nodkrai_overview_03","bwiki_nodkrai_overview"]},{"fact_id":"nodkrai_fact_015","text":"近期狂猎背后的猎月人完成复活并持续攫取月矩力，使威胁进一步升级；挪德卡莱各方势力因此开始寻求联合行动。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当前危机","visibility":"restricted_knowledge","source_ids":["local_sup_nodkrai_overview_01","local_sup_nodkrai_overview_03"]},{"fact_id":"nodkrai_fact_016","text":"西风骑士团远征队已在挪德卡莱活动并设立集结点，同时与当地情报渠道及战力合作应对危机。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"近期至现状","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_nodkrai_overview","local_sup_nodkrai_overview_03"]},{"fact_id":"nodkrai_fact_017","text":"据法尔伽所述，北大陆情报网的总部位于挪德卡莱，并在各国拥有合作者；其现任当家为奈芙尔。","status":"reported","temporal_scope":"现状","visibility":"restricted_knowledge","source_ids":["local_sup_nodkrai_overview_03"]}],"timeline":[{"period":"远古时期","order_hint":1,"events":["一轮未能显化的第四轮月亮留下残余，成为挪德卡莱月亮起源叙事的基础。"],"current_status":"该月之遗存仍是理解挪德卡莱、古月遗骸及月矩力的重要背景。","source_ids":["fandom_nodkrai_overview","bwiki_nodkrai_overview"]},{"period":"灾变之后至数百年来","order_hint":2,"events":["狂猎开始长期侵袭挪德卡莱。","执灯人为抵御狂猎与深渊威胁而持续作战。"],"current_status":"狂猎未被彻底清除，执灯人的防卫使命仍在继续。","source_ids":["fandom_nodkrai_overview","local_sup_nodkrai_overview_03","bwiki_nodkrai_overview"]},{"period":"时期不详的开发阶段及其后","order_hint":3,"events":["挪德卡莱一度计划或经历大规模开发。","相关开发如今几乎不留完整痕迹，仅有大量废弃零件和残骸散落。"],"current_status":"昔日开发痕迹已严重衰败，无法构成稳定秩序。","source_ids":["fandom_nodkrai_overview"]},{"period":"西风骑士团近期远征","order_hint":4,"events":["西风骑士团根据远征取得的新线索前往挪德卡莱。","远征队在当地设立集结点，并与本地情报网络合作。"],"current_status":"远征队目前仍是应对地区危机的外来力量之一。","source_ids":["fandom_nodkrai_overview","local_sup_nodkrai_overview_03"]},{"period":"当前危机","order_hint":5,"events":["猎月人借助月矩力完成复活，狂猎威胁由长期灾害演变为具有明确行动目标的危机。","挪德卡莱主要战力与情报势力开始协调调查、牵制和对抗行动。"],"current_status":"猎月人仍在增强力量，各方联合应对尚未彻底解决危机。","source_ids":["local_sup_nodkrai_overview_01","local_sup_nodkrai_overview_03"]}],"relationships":[],"in_world_visibility":{"public_summary":"挪德卡莱通常被外界视为至冬南端的自治边境、冒险家与各方人士汇聚之地；其严寒环境、复杂治安、月矩力技术和狂猎威胁在当地并非秘密。","likely_known_by":["挪德卡莱居民与商人","伏尼契商会成员","霜月之子","执灯人","驻当地的愚人众人员","西风骑士团远征队","曾在当地行商的商旅与冒险家","驻当地或准备前往当地的记者及通讯员"],"unlikely_known_by":["远离挪德卡莱且没有当地情报渠道的普通民众","不了解古代月亮历史者","未参与当前危机调查者"],"common_beliefs_or_misconceptions":["挪德卡莱具有“冒险家的乐园”与“乐园”的广泛声誉。","把“乐园”的声誉理解为当地安全、秩序稳定并不准确；利本的遭遇显示商旅可能多次遭到抢劫。","一般居民未必知道库塔尔与哥伦比娅的具体关系，也未必了解狂猎背后猎月人的真实身份。"]},"activation_keys":["挪德卡莱","Nod-Krai"],"excluded_material":{"gameplay_only":["月矩力极性机关、推拉操作、解谜流程及强化状态","化身为kuuhenki的操作方式与持续时间","宝箱、月之印、神像供奉奖励及收集品奖励","敌人生命值、抗性、护盾、伤害倍率和特殊战斗状态","任务步骤、试用角色属性、武器、圣遗物及成就奖励","商店商品价格、库存与刷新时间","传送点、按钮操作、关卡检查点及特殊剧情模式规则"],"unsupported_or_speculative":["月之轮与神之眼必然源自完全相同原理的推测","关于特殊月之轮外观成因的推测","BWiki所述现实地理原型、文化原型及编辑者考据","BWiki关于角色是否实装、地区层级分类及剧情走向的编辑性判断","法尔伽关于猎月人是否布置疑阵、其复活是否反而有利的个人推测","商人关于霜月之子盗取机械及其具体动机的推断","未成功取得正文的“Woe Is Me...”页面中的任何具体说法"]},"sources":[{"source_id":"fandom_nodkrai_overview","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Nod-Krai","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Nod-Krai","language":"en","revision_id":"2136063","source_text_sha256":"183b19573c2c5e0c535d47273a0a17a6b6211d0a235c55e1cd87aa758566c6e5"},{"source_id":"bwiki_nodkrai_overview","provider":"bwiki","role":"cross_language_verification","title":"挪德卡莱","url":"https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/%E6%8C%AA%E5%BE%B7%E5%8D%A1%E8%8E%B1","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"674049","source_text_sha256":"b476d633c935eb1d2655e475118b1e07a5c7c26cac813416ffebd8fbaa28cd58"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_nodkrai_overview_01","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Liben","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Liben","language":"en","revision_id":"2090402","source_text_sha256":"05eb1bfd1df3cd127d7542087ed327b9782aec9d7c8ec58f90c8ef706b3f2c9d"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_nodkrai_overview_02","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Charlotte: A Wrench in the Works","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Charlotte%3A_A_Wrench_in_the_Works","language":"en","revision_id":"2127394","source_text_sha256":"e1704ce27942a511d8f6830c0ce55c4908e00e799ae8687356444cba84a7a59d"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_nodkrai_overview_05","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Ineffa/Profile","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Ineffa/Profile","language":"en","revision_id":"2129867","source_text_sha256":"ec963bcbabd803ec46181847352f06b213483dce19a3a409c052fb05fce1e87a"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_nodkrai_overview_06","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Moon Wheel","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Moon_Wheel","language":"en","revision_id":"2093359","source_text_sha256":"e2dac8fb239350ecdb71c8e57f5091a208f907419d4b9d6868f4bed1c279f428"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_nodkrai_overview_07","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Kofitse","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Kofitse","language":"en","revision_id":"2135834","source_text_sha256":"2d78ed076e95b87f098878f011488372dab7842b4aa050ed2938a1ef0bb4fb0a"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_nodkrai_overview_08","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"In the Shadows of Night","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/In_the_Shadows_of_Night","language":"en","revision_id":"2129106","source_text_sha256":"c501869f59f2618294f00dedbeb1a6ca8623734ec4be0f6ca3c5dfc1a8358152"},{"source_id":"local_sup_nodkrai_overview_01","provider":"local_dialogue","role":"local_dialogue_verification","title":"匿于阴影","url":"local://YuanShenResources/CHS/Quest/Quest_6012.json#unit=601210","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"OSCBWin6.7.54","source_text_sha256":"09d2126ceeffba28b53696d2ecc3ea2a3beca9e715c861b048320994a108dc43"},{"source_id":"local_sup_nodkrai_overview_03","provider":"local_dialogue","role":"local_dialogue_verification","title":"匿于阴影","url":"local://YuanShenResources/CHS/Quest/Quest_6012.json#unit=601208","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"OSCBWin6.7.54","source_text_sha256":"2e871ea3097e9ba928c935241ee995fe39c76378a387238a2a9e62f295449015"},{"source_id":"local_sup_nodkrai_overview_04","provider":"local_dialogue","role":"local_dialogue_verification","title":"咚咚咚，大阴谋！","url":"local://YuanShenResources/CHS/Quest/Quest_40205.json#unit=4020505","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"OSCBWin6.7.54","source_text_sha256":"85a07e1e8db48ee3cd11a485d4ee9ce3ca6f35a05ce9928cc1d86e6b67db0714"}],"evidence_bundle_sha256":"b996d85920d038be0cd1b28ef84f4b41560f8c81f602999126c86c43e7f8cd0a","review":{"cross_language_conflicts":[],"uncertain_claims":["英文资料将“borderlands”列为挪德卡莱别称，但中文核验材料未给出对应的正式中文别名，因此未自行添加中文译名。"],"missing_evidence":[],"needs_human_review":false}}